ages/dw/20211113/536138928793980928914862.png/5wrtx_kz1NIFgucnJVMKppf7Y72pfhXhqdFQAanRUAE\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138931109367808389726.png/fCyQ9hzRwrKgUtIoHBPA5l2gJAapf6Yh4pfmF-KX5hc\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138933261176832035172.png/gUXBeFidlN9je4-T72erL04u7LFTlZhuVCjLQFQoy0A\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138935874359296873619.png/_PD8IGjyScYgEPwYfDxQRgnkjS2MmeI-XQ_lx10P5cc\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,宣傳圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138938630148096624978.png/8wqyOuD7QidXxiWY3e85O5bv0zjicytfRhdDFkYXQxY\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138941486600192760842.png/p6FzlLwx6DSlNocTi_YzXxogy2WD_BaWZuOIVGbjiFQ\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138943944593408502971.png/-lMGbJzg2tgBaIdK3M51fqXG99L4lahWimOwQIpjsEA\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211113/536138870845083648851673.png/xsTKt0HI9OfEUiBHJHJZ7If1j3-qC3r2OWQpYzlkKWM\"/><figcaption>5部菅田將暉的必看作品（01製圖,電影擷圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《觀察者網》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T03:05:14.195607+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2261,"images":35,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}